→ 07_Export_PDF_Sheet\" 582x42 :: → menu → 02_Home_Chats | → export → 07_Export_PDF_Sheet\n        FRAME 2:57 \"07_Export_PDF_Sheet\" 632x329 fill#f7f7fa\n          TEXT 2:58 \"07_Export_PDF_Sheet\" 582x27 :: 07_Export_PDF_Sheet\n          TEXT 2:59 \"Goal: Name and export the conversation as PDF.\" 582x21 :: Goal: Name and export the conversation as PDF.\n          TEXT 2:60 \"MUST INCLUDE\" 582x17 :: MUST INCLUDE\n          TEXT 2:61 \"• Actions: close · Export • Copy: “Export as PDF” · “All your conversations with Chat Bot AI will be exported as PDF. Please choose a title for this file” • Form: Title “The story of a student” • Media: PDF_File_Icon • Presentation: sheet over 06_Chat_Conversation; the conversation stays behind it\" 582x126 :: • Actions: close · Export | • Copy: “Export as PDF” · “All your conversations with Chat Bot AI will be exported as PDF. Please choose a title for this file” | • Form: Title “The story of a student” | • Media: PDF_File_Icon | • Presentation: sheet over 06_Chat_Conversation; the conversation stays behind it\n          TEXT 2:62 \"LINKS\" 582x17 :: LINKS\n          TEXT 2:63 \"→ close → 06 · Export → 06\" 582x21 :: → close → 06 · Export → 06\n        FRAME 2:64 \"08_Profile_Settings\" 632x434 fill#f7f7fa\n          TEXT 2:65 \"08_Profile_Settings\" 582x27 :: 08_Profile_Settings\n          TEXT 2:66 \"Goal: Check the account and reach settings.\" 582x21 :: Goal: Check the account and reach settings.\n          TEXT 2:67 \"MUST INCLUDE\" 582x17 :: MUST INCLUDE\n          TEXT 2:68 \"• Account: avatar · Sam Rivera · “premium account” · “278 days until the end of the premium account” • Actions: back · more • Copy: “Profile & Settings” • Footer: “Chat Bot AI - Version 2.0.5” · Terms of use · Privacy policy • Settings: Change password · Data & storage “83% Used” · Email sam.rivera@example.com · Send feedback (“Chat Bot AI can make mistakes. Consider checking important information and send us your feedback”) · Theme “System default”\" 5