, warning, error, disabled), storage-breakdown colors, type scale, weights per role, spacing, radii and elevation.\" 1072x72 :: Fixed: the brand primary color and the two typefaces below — they carry the Chat Bot AI identity. Everything else is yours to define and apply consistently: neutrals and grays, text colors, surfaces and backgrounds, semantic colors (success, warning, error, disabled), storage-breakdown colors, type scale, weights per role, spacing, radii and elevation.\n  FRAME 3:5 \"Brand color\" 1072x314\n    TEXT 3:6 \"Brand color\" 1072x30 :: Brand color\n    FRAME 3:7 \"Brand primary\" 240x272\n      RECTANGLE 3:8 \"Rectangle\" 240x140 fill#612a74\n      TEXT 3:9 \"Brand primary\" 240x24 :: Brand primary\n      TEXT 3:10 \"#612A74\" 240x21 :: #612A74\n      TEXT 3:11 \"The Chat Bot AI brand color. Where and how much to use it is your decision.\" 240x63 :: The Chat Bot AI brand color. Where and how much to use it is your decision.\n  FRAME 3:12 \"Typefaces\" 1072x1303\n    TEXT 3:13 \"Typefaces\" 1072x30 :: Typefaces\n    TEXT 3:14 \"Bricolage Grotesque\" 1072x60 :: Bricolage Grotesque\n    TEXT 3:15 \"Nunito Aa Bb Cc 0123456789 12.48 GB\" 0x1131 :: Nunito  Aa Bb Cc 0123456789  12.48 GB\n    TEXT 3:16 \"Bricolage Grotesque comes from the source kit. Nunito replaces SF Pro Rounded (Apple-only, not available on every machine). Which face, size, weight and line height goes where is yours to define as a consistent type scale.\" 1072x46 :: Bricolage Grotesque comes from the source kit. Nunito replaces SF Pro Rounded (Apple-only, not available on every machine). Which face, size, weight and line height goes where is yours to define as a consistent type scale.\n  TEXT 3:17 \"Canvas: 428 × 928 (iPhone). Light mode only.\" 1072x23 :: Canvas: 428 × 928 (iPhone). Light mode only."}],"_meta":{"mcpRequestId":"23309c4d-6e7b-4ad2-afdf-007c7eef47dd"}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_bdrk_01RuBw2QDBUu9ErF2UXbgpWf","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"co